   "text": "Legend\n\nblue = from BODHI-S (build_rules.py)\ngreen = fake data (seed.py)\nred = hand-written safety (seed.py)\norange = written by the agent\n\nPK = primary key \u00b7 FK = foreign key\narrow: child \u2192 parent it points to",
   "originalText": "Legend\n\nblue = from BODHI-S (build_rules.py)\ngreen = fake data (seed.py)\nred = hand-written safety (seed.py)\norange = written by the agent\n\nPK = primary key \u00b7 FK = foreign key\narrow: child \u2192 parent it points to",
